# vergeio_tenant_snapshots (Data Source)

Lists the snapshots VergeOS has for one tenant, including snapshots this configuration did not create. The list is ordered by name. `id` is the snapshot key, and it is the value `terraform import vergeio_tenant_snapshot.example <id>` accepts.

`type` is the coverage the API returns: `full`, `partial_include`, or `partial_exclude`. The tenant UI labels cloud snapshots Provider or Local. That label is not a field on these rows, so this data source does not report it. `expires` is null when the snapshot does not expire.

[`vergeio_tenant_snapshot`](../resources/tenant_snapshot.html) keeps one snapshot in state. The action of the same name takes a snapshot and does not.

