## Schema

### Required

- `tenant_id` (String) Key of the parent `vergeio_tenant`, the same value as `vergeio_tenant.id`.

### Read-Only

- `snapshots` (Attributes List) Snapshots VergeOS has for this tenant. (see [below for nested schema](#nestedatt--snapshots))

<a id="nestedatt--snapshots"></a>
### Nested Schema for `snapshots`

Read-Only:

- `created` (Number) Creation time as a Unix timestamp.
- `expires` (Number) Expiration time as a Unix timestamp. Null when the snapshot does not expire.
- `id` (String) Snapshot key. Import `vergeio_tenant_snapshot` with this value.
- `name` (String) Snapshot name.
- `type` (String) Snapshot coverage: `full`, `partial_include`, or `partial_exclude`.
